window.products.push({"id":146071,"name":"2198202 Refrigerator Cold Control Thermostat, Compatible with Whirlpool Kenmore Roper Refrigerators. Replaces 1110552 1115242 1129437 2161283 2161284 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nVCW3TFmS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This thermostat assembly is used in refrigerator units and freezers as a sensor. The thermostat senses the temperature increase in the evaporator during the cycle of defrosting and turns off when ice is melted. Replaces Part Numbers: 1110552; 1115242; 1115243 1115244; 1115245; 1129437 2161283; 2161284; 2169112 2169113; 2299; AP3037004; PS329884; WP2198202VP, WP2198202, AP6006166, 2198201, 99989726 etc Works with brands: Frigidaire, Kenmore, Crosley, Westinghouse, Gibson and others. Work With Models: ◆ Wirlpool : 2VED27TKN00; 2VED27TKW00 2VED27TKFN00; 2VED27TKFN01 2VED27TKFW00; 2VED27TKFW01 ◆ Kenmore/Sears : 106.9557652 106.9557914 106.9557915 106.9557924 106.9557925 106.9557955 106.9557984 106.9557985 6778 ◆ Roper : RS20CKXAL00 RS20CKXAW01 RS20DKXDN02 RS20DKXDW02 RS20DKXFW00 RS20EKXBW00 ◆ Amana : ASD2522WRD04 ASD2522WRS03 ASD2522WRS04 ASD2522WRS07 ASD2522WRW03 etc. Fixes the following symptoms: If you have any of the following symptoms, replacing your appliance could solve the problem ◆ Freezer too cold ◆ Freezer section too warm ◆ The compressor won't turn on ◆ Too warm ◆ Frost buildup. Instruction when replacement: The tools needed for this repair project is a putty knife, Phillips and flat blade screw driver, 1/4 inch nut driver, and needle nose pliers. Remember to unplug refrigerator from power source as a safety precaution. Refer to the manual provided by the manufacturer for further installation instructions. Please reach out to us if you have a question about compatibility. Comment below in the customer questions and answer section or send us a message on the us storefront. We’re happy to help ensure you select the right part number for your Washer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nVCW3TFmS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Knob","source_asin":"B08GH2J9S4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-146071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GH2J9S4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GH2J9S4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
