window.products.push({"id":146770,"name":"W10290353 W10290350 Buner Porcelain Drip Pan - Replacement for Whirlpool Amana Crosley Electric Range Cooktop - Includes 2 Small 6-Inch and 2 8-Inch L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717iG5BH53L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【W10290350 W10290353 BURNER DRIP PAN】--The W10290350 W10290353 burner electric range are partially located on the top and inside of the appliance, is used to collect oil/water droplets/food that leaks during cooking and can prevent electric shock to the user, to keep it safe. Speed up cooking time, save energy and give a fresh look to the top of the cooker. ▶The W10290350 W10290353 burner drip pans are easy to clean and can be cleaned with a cloth, paper towel, soap or dishwasher. ✅【HIGH-QUALITY PORCELAIN】-- Includes 2 x 8\" W10290350 drip pan and 2 x 6\" W10290353 drip pan. The 4 pack of W10290350 W10290353 black porcelain drip pans are made of high-quality porcelain with chrome finish, and have a notch in their burner support. Good hardness and high temperature resistance. Robust and durable, ensuring long-term and effective use. If your drip pans is corroded or damaged, it needs to be replaced. ✅【90 DAYS WARRANTY】-- The W10290350 W10290353 burner electric range porcelain drip pan bowls supports 90 days RETURN and EXCHANGE. ▶W10290350 W1029035 Drip pans have a purpose beyond looking attractive. Drip bowls capture and reflect heat back to the coil which makes the burner work more efficiently. Drip bowls also catch spills that otherwise would drip down into the internal workings of the stove and can prevent electric shock to the user. ✅【COMPATIBILITY】-- W10290350 and W10290353 Replacement range cooktop porcelain drip pans replacement for Whirl-pool, Am-ana, Cro-sley, Jenn Air, Magic Chef,May-tag and more brand range. ①W10290350 replaces part numbers 1557767, AP4507834, EAP2377814, PS2377814. Compatible with the following models: AER5511ACB, AER5511ACW, AER5511BAB, AER5515QCW, AER5515RCW, 6551WUA, 6551WUW, 6551XUA, etc. ②W10290353 replaces part numbers 1552871, AP4501360, EAP2373229, PS2373229. ✅【EASY INSTALLATION】-- W10290350 and W10290353 drip bowls can be installed under 8 \"and 6\" burner elements. Power off and put on working gloves before installation. Wait until the surface is cool to the touch before installing this part. No tools are required for this process. You can find videos on YouTube on how to change parts, it's not hard at all.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717iG5BH53L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08PBDVDKG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-146770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PBDVDKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PBDVDKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
