window.products.push({"id":146940,"name":"Ivation Automatic Ice Cream Maker Machine, No Pre-freezing Necessary with Built-in Compressor, Stainless Steel Gelato Maker, LCD Screen, Digital Timer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717AVrHwneL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ice cream in an instant! Next time a craving hits, tickle your tastebuds in no time with the Ivation Automatic Soft Serve Ice Cream Maker. This chic little appliance takes your dessert-making to the next level, turning your kitchen into the ultimate ice cream parlor where dreams of yummy banana, scrumptious chocolate, sweet vanilla, and tasty caramel are just a press away. Instead of waiting an entire day for your bowl to freeze, a built-in compressor churns and chills your ingredients quickly and consistently, resulting in the coldest, creamiest ice cream that’s ever come from your countertop. And with easy-clean removable parts, modern stainless steel, simple LCD controls, a fun see-through cover, and bonus recipe book, the machine makes a cool gift for frozen yogurt, sherbet, sorbet, and gelato lovers of all ages. Add an Ivation Automatic Soft Serve Ice Cream Maker to your cart today! Fresh frozen creations—without the wait! Love making your own ice cream, but loathe the long, drawn-out process of waiting for things to freeze? Chill out. The Ivation Automatic Soft Serve Ice Cream Maker significantly speeds up the process, eliminating the need for pre-frozen bowls, old-school salt and ice mixtures, and tiresome hand cranking. As long as you have a few yummy ingredients and a hankering for homemade indulgence, you’ll be scooping out chilly deliciousness in no time.  Contemporary Design With its elegant silhouette and cool stainless body, this machine earned its spot on your counter. Auto Safety Shutoff The self-protecting motor automatically powers down when ice cream becomes hardened.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717AVrHwneL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivation","source_asin":"B08QZXV1QV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-146940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QZXV1QV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QZXV1QV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
