window.products.push({"id":146981,"name":"Ice Makers Countertop, Self-Cleaning Function, Portable Electric Ice Cube Maker Machine, 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 6 Mins, 26lbs 24Hrs with Ice Scoop and B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c3cl6yTFL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【New Upgrated Ice Maker Machine】FOOING's newly designed bullet-type ice makers countertop prime clearance equipped with a highly efficient compressor, it can produce 9 delicious ice cubes in just 7 minutes. Keep the water tank full of water, home ice maker will produce 26 pounds of ice in 24 hours, providing you to eat fresh and crunchy ice all day long. All to bring you the best possible drinking experience. 【Auto Self-Cleaning】 Our counter top ice maker machine features an auto self-cleaning mode that helps you to clean the machine inside easily before use. All you have to do is adding some water to the ice cube maker, and start the self-cleaning function by long pressing the ON/OFF button. It will automatically clean the ice machine inside areas that you can’t reach, making sure you get the cleanest and freshest ice cubes. 【2 Sizes of Ice Cube Selectable】 FOOING ice maker machine for countertop offers two ice size options, allowing you to choose a suitable cube for your favorite drinks. The large ice is great for filling in a cooler, while the small cubes can be easily broken up by a blender, suitable for making smoothies or other frozen drinks. 【Intelligent Control Panel】This counter ice maker machine is lower than 45dB, means your entertainment won't be disturbed. With an easy-to-use control panel, you can also track its ice-making production through the translucent window. The portable ice maker countertop top rated prime will also remind you to take out the ice cubes when the basket is full with ICE FULL indicator and inform you to add the water with ADD WATER lights on when the ice maker lacks of water. 【1 Year Warranty for Ice Makers countertop】FOOING offers a 12-month warranty and lifetime support for tabletop ice maker machine. Customer satisfaction is our first consideration. Moreover, the well-designed package of sonic ice maker can be the choice of gift for others.Each nugget ice maker is equipped with an ice basket and an ice shovel. Make sure that these accessories are present when you receive the goods, and if there are any missing, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c3cl6yTFL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOOING","source_asin":"B09FLHRGH2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-146981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FLHRGH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FLHRGH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
