window.products.push({"id":146990,"name":"MontoPack Disposable Stove Guards | Aluminum Foil Gas Range Stovetop Protectors for Home, Restaurant, Foodservice & Catering | Sturdy, Eco-Friendly & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BTOkooZvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP YOUR STOVETOP CLEANER THAN NEW! Our versatile gas stove liners give you freedom to cook all day, every day, without worrying about messy spills, stains, scratches, scorches, food residue, and other common wear. Simply place a disposable protector on each burner to avoid the endless scrubbing, and keep your cooktop in perfect condition. DURABLY CONSTRUCTED TO BEAT THE HEAT! Heavy-duty aluminum foil material offers lightweight convenience, exceptional durability, and reliable heat conductivity, making it perfect for high-traffic appliances in homes, restaurant kitchens, catering facilities, food trucks, and more. Our silver covers also blend seamlessly with stainless steel surfaces. STANDARD SIZING THAT’S WILLING TO FLEX! Our square stovetop covers measure 8 ½” on each side and 3 ½” at the center opening, which is compatible with most of today’s popular residential and commercial stoves. Flexible foil may be custom adapted to fit separate and continuous grates, while integrated grooves help catch grease and oil. NEAT AND CLEAN AND SWEET TO EARTH! Here at MontoPack, we’re super conscious of the impact of our single-use and disposable products. Rest assured—these bib liners are 100% recyclable and built to last for multiple mealtime preparations. Stay true to your green beliefs while preserving your appliances and ensuring utmost food safety and hygiene. BUY BULK VALUE FOR SIZZLING SAVINGS! Stock up on your essential foodservice supplies with our handy pack of 100 stovetop splatter guards. Whether you’re running a business or simplifying your home cleaning schedule, these affordable odorless covers bring ultimate peace of mind. Skip the noxious sprays and cleaners—and start lining today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BTOkooZvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MontoPack","source_asin":"B09DDD2V85","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-146990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DDD2V85","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DDD2V85","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":146991,"name":"80040 Washer Agitator Dogs Whirlpool Kenmore Maytag Dog Agits 80040 FSP AP3119063 PS388034 Directional Part Ultra Durable Replacement 110.23832100 110","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tsUixan1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Ultra Durable 80040 Washer Agitator Dog Replacement Kit - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers 80040A, P3119063, 285612, 285770, 3109, 3366877, 387091, 80040VP, 99989668, AH388034, EA388034, LP338, PS388034, TJ90LP338. Dog Agits 80040 is compatible with Whirlpool, Crosley, Estate, Inglis, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Maytag, Roper. Kenmore Washing Machine Agitator Repair Kit 80040 will help if your appliance does not agitate, is noisy, pumps but does not spin, or spins slowly. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Agitator Dogs 80040? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Symptoms: noisy, pumps but does not spin, or spins slowly. To replace Kenmore Agitator Dogs 80040 it is important to identify the correct part number and specifications that match the make and model of your washing machine. This part comes in white/beige. It fits hundreds of models. 💡 Kenmore 80040 Agitator Dogs are small plastic parts located inside the agitator of a washing machine, which are responsible for gripping and turning the agitator during the wash cycle. Whirlpool Agitator Dogs 80040 are found in the top part of the agitator and are essential for the agitator to work effectively. Whirlpool 80040 Washer Agitator Dogs meet or exceed all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Are washer agitator dogs universal? No, washer agitator dogs are not universal. Different brands and models of washing machines require specific agitator dogs that are compatible with their design. Therefore, it is essential to check your washing machine's owner's manual to ensure that you get the correct part for your machine. Additionally, some newer models of washing machines may not have agitator dogs at all, as they may use different types of agitators or no agitator at all. 💡 How long do agitator dogs last? The lifespan of Dog Agitator 80040 can vary depending on several factors, such as the frequency of use, the load size, and the type of fabric being washed. Generally, Whirlpool 80040 Washer Agitator Dogs can last anywhere from 2 to 5 years, but they may wear out sooner if the washing machine is used frequently or if it is subjected to heavy loads. Regular maintenance of your washing machine can help extend the lifespan of the agitator dogs and other components.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tsUixan1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B09BB4X4BN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-146991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BB4X4BN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BB4X4BN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
